    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange (ECSE)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-10-08T11:33:50.870Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":2},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse25-25thanniversary-learntoinvest-activity-7513924617879674880-jBXc","text":"As part of the ECSE’s 25th Anniversary celebration, we are doubling down on our commitment to financial inclusion and investor education. Stepping into the securities market doesn’t require a finance degree—it just starts with the basics.   \n\nWhen you invest in listed securities, you put your money to work in regional enterprises shaping our collective future. Understanding concepts like equities, retail bonds, and dividends gives you the confidence to build long-term financial security.   \n\n💡 Knowledge builds confidence. \n\n#ECSE25 #25thAnniversary #LearnToInvest #FinancialLiteracy #InvestCaribbean #WealthCreation","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse25-25thanniversary-learntoinvest-activity-7513924617879674880-jBXc"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange (ECSE)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-10-05T14:08:34.828Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":0},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse25-25thanniversary-capitalgrowth-activity-7512876394029359105-S0tO","text":"ECSE has served as more than a place to raise funds—it has been a regional platform for sustainable growth, stronger governance, and long-term competitiveness. As we approach our 25th Anniversary, we are paving the way for the next cohort of regional enterprises.  \n\nIf your enterprise is ready for its next chapter, the Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange offers an alternative pathway to access growth capital and elevate your corporate profile. Discover how listing on the ECSE can position your business for decades of success.  \n \n#ECSE25 #25thAnniversary #CapitalGrowth #CaribbeanBusiness #BusinessGrowth #ListingPathways","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse25-25thanniversary-capitalgrowth-activity-7512876394029359105-S0tO"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange (ECSE)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-10-01T18:10:48.943Z","headline":"","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":1},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_as-the-ecse-approaches-a-major-milestone-activity-7511487803059322880-ZKuR","text":"As the ECSE approaches a major milestone of 25 years of operations, the CEO is looking toward to an exciting future. His ultimate vision is a vibrant, digital, and trusted capital market that gives every citizen the opportunity to easily access, understand, and participate in building wealth. By creating this inclusive financial foundation, the ECSE is making it possible for individuals to grow their finances, businesses to fund their expansions, and governments to finance essential projects.\nCatch the full interview on YouTube to see what's next for the ECSE: https://lnkd.in/e6-bvAcm","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_as-the-ecse-approaches-a-major-milestone-activity-7511487803059322880-ZKuR"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange (ECSE)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-09-30T10:51:01.234Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":0},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse-annualgeneralmeeting-agm2026-activity-7511014737124470785-BluH","text":"Notice of 25th Annual General Meeting\n\nThe Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange (ECSE) will host its 25th Annual General Meeting on:\n* Date: Friday, October 2, 2026\n* Time: 6:00 PM\n* Location: St. Kitts Marriott Beach Resort, St. Kitts (and virtually via Zoom)\nRead the full notice and meeting details on our website:\n🔗 https://lnkd.in/ekBY9mzs\n\n#ECSE #AnnualGeneralMeeting #AGM2026 #EasternCaribbean #SecuritiesExchange","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse-annualgeneralmeeting-agm2026-activity-7511014737124470785-BluH"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange (ECSE)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-09-16T20:02:14.560Z","headline":"","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":0},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse-businessgrowth-sme-activity-7506080026841268224-T7jd","text":"Is your business ready for its next chapter of growth? The ECSE provides a structured, credible platform for enterprises across the OECS to raise capital and enhance competitiveness.\n\n📄 Download issuer guides and explore listing options at ecseonline.com!\n\n#ECSE #BusinessGrowth #SME #CapitalMarkets #CaribbeanBusiness #ListOnECSE","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse-businessgrowth-sme-activity-7506080026841268224-T7jd"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange (ECSE)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-09-11T11:55:32.571Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":1},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse25-shapingthefuture-easterncaribbean-activity-7504145605309431812-DUlK","text":"For 25 years, the Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange has built a secure, trusted platform for regional capital. But we aren't just looking back—we are using this foundation to open new doors for everyday investors and growing businesses across the OECS.\n\nThe next chapter of regional wealth building starts today. Discover how you fit into the future of our capital market at ecseonline.com.\n\n#ECSE25 #ShapingTheFuture #EasternCaribbean #InvestLocal #OECS","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse25-shapingthefuture-easterncaribbean-activity-7504145605309431812-DUlK"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange (ECSE)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-09-09T11:38:29.395Z","headline":"","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":2},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse25-shapingthefuture-capitalmarkets-activity-7503416538306232320-1_A6","text":"For 25 years, we’ve built a trusted market. Now, we’re building broader participation for you. Explore the next phase of investment, technology, and economic growth across the Eastern Caribbean.\n\n🌐 Visit ecseonline.com\n\n📺 Watch full feature videos on the ECSE YouTube Channel\n\n#ECSE25 #ShapingTheFuture #CapitalMarkets #InvestLocal #CaribbeanGrowth","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse25-shapingthefuture-capitalmarkets-activity-7503416538306232320-1_A6"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange (ECSE)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-09-02T10:57:36.499Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":1},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse-learntoinvest-financialliteracy-activity-7500869534820528130-_S1G","text":"Understanding the language of the market is your first step toward confident investing.\n\n🔗 Learn more at ecseonline.com\n\n#ECSE #LearnToInvest #FinancialLiteracy #MarketTerminology #InvestSmart","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse-learntoinvest-financialliteracy-activity-7500869534820528130-_S1G"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange (ECSE)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-08-24T11:28:16.402Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":0},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse-caribbeanbusiness-listonecse-activity-7497615761142693888-Qjmi","text":"The ECSE is more than an exchange—it is a launchpad for enterprise. Raising capital through equities or corporate bonds allows your business to innovate, expand, and strengthen its governance.\n\nReady to explore listing pathways for your business? Connect with an ECSE-licensed broker-dealer or financial advisor today at ecseonline.com.\n\n#ECSE #BusinessGrowth#CapitalMarkets #CaribbeanBusiness #ListOnECSE","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse-caribbeanbusiness-listonecse-activity-7497615761142693888-Qjmi"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange (ECSE)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-08-21T11:15:11.396Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":1},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse-discoverecse-listedcompanies-activity-7496525305033957376-si-d","text":"From essential services to commercial banking, publicly listed companies on the ECSE drive economic value across our islands. Investing in listed equities lets you take a direct stake in the businesses powering the Eastern Caribbean.\n\nExplore all listed securities and daily market reports at ecseonline.com.\n\n#ECSE #DiscoverECSE #ListedCompanies #CaribbeanEconomy #InvestLocal","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange_ecse-discoverecse-listedcompanies-activity-7496525305033957376-si-d"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange (ECSE)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eastern-caribbean-securities-exchange","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","addressCountry":"KN"},"description":"Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange is a company based out of Saint Kitts And Nevis.","numberOfEmployees":{"value":11,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C560BAQG22yjiueuVQw/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1630574924601/eastern_caribbean_securities_exchange_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=JQvZ7Bc6pcXK1EEY50WXXKEaIpdmc86_npeV9wIyFbo","description":"Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange (ECSE)","@type":"ImageObject"},"slogan":"Investing in the future ","sameAs":"https://www.ecseonline.com"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
