  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">As part of the ECSE’s 25th Anniversary celebration, we are doubling down on our commitment to financial inclusion and investor education. Stepping into the securities market doesn’t require a finance degree—it just starts with the basics.   

When you invest in listed securities, you put your money to work in regional enterprises shaping our collective future. Understanding concepts like equities, retail bonds, and dividends gives you the confidence to build long-term financial security.   

💡 Knowledge builds confidence. 

