    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Notice of 25th Annual General Meeting

The Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange (ECSE) will host its 25th Annual General Meeting on:
* Date: Friday, October 2, 2026
* Time: 6:00 PM
* Location: St. Kitts Marriott Beach Resort, St. Kitts (and virtually via Zoom)
