        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">For 25 years, the Eastern Caribbean Securities Exchange has built a secure, trusted platform for regional capital. But we aren't just looking back—we are using this foundation to open new doors for everyday investors and growing businesses across the OECS.

